Action: get_structure_from_mp_text
Action Input: {"mp_id": "mp-30", "file_path": "/results/2_AUGUST_2025/gpt_4o/react/bulk_modulus/brief/tasks/copper_bulk_modulus_trial_3/copper_structure.cif"}

Thought: The structure of copper has been successfully saved. Next, I need to convert this structure into a LAMMPS data file, which will be used for the simulation. I will use the `convert_structure_to_lammps_data` tool for this purpose.
